          1,
          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La vez pasada, el dios de la tormenta atacó a todos sus hermanos, y solo Tū quedó de pie.",
          "en": "Last time, the storm god attacked all of his brothers, and only Tū was left standing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los demás se habían escondido o habían huido.",
          "en": "The others had hidden away, or run for their lives."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tū estaba herido y furioso. «Me dejaron pelear solo», pensó.",
          "en": "Tū was hurt and furious. 'They left me to fight alone,' he thought."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y decidió hacérselo pagar a todos.",
          "en": "And he decided to make every one of them pay."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esta parte también viene del libro de Grey, de los escritos de Te Rangikāheke.",
          "en": "This part also comes from Grey's book, from the writings of Te Rangikāheke."
        }
      ],
